\begin_layout Proof

\series bold
\begin_inset space \quad{}
\end_inset


\begin_inset Formula $(\Rightarrow)$
\end_inset

 
\series default
Assume a monotone and continuous preference 
\begin_inset Formula $\succsim$
\end_inset

 is homothetic.
 We want to show that 
\begin_inset Formula $\succsim$
\end_inset

 admits a continuous representation 
\begin_inset Formula $u:X\rightarrow\mathbb{R}$
\end_inset

 that is homogeneous of degree one.
